{"kind": "weekly", "period": "2026-W34", "prepared_on": "2026-08-22", "html": "<div style=\"font-family:-apple-system,'PingFang TC','Helvetica Neue',Arial,sans-serif;max-width:680px;margin:0 auto;color:#16213e;\">\n<div style=\"font-size:20px;font-weight:800;color:#1a2b4a;border-left:5px solid #5b8def;padding-left:12px;margin:0 0 18px;\">📅 本週 AI 新聞回顧 · 2026-08-17 ～ 2026-08-21</div>\n\n<div style=\"background:#fbf3e3;border-left:5px solid #d99b3f;border-radius:10px;padding:13px 16px;margin-bottom:11px;\">\n  <div style=\"font-size:15px;font-weight:800;color:#16213e;line-height:1.4;\"><span style=\"color:#d99b3f;font-weight:800;\">1.</span> OpenAI hit the brakes. Now what?<span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#fff;color:#b9791f;font-size:11px;font-weight:700;padding:1px 8px;border-radius:20px;margin-left:5px;\">政策</span></div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:13px;color:#5b6470;margin:3px 0 6px;\">OpenAI 踩下煞車，接下來呢？</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#555c68;line-height:1.55;\">Facing IPO pressure and fierce competition from Anthropic and Chinese rivals, OpenAI said this week it slowed the pace of some AI development to tighten security and safety measures.</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#8a909c;margin-top:3px;line-height:1.55;\">面對即將上市的壓力，以及來自Anthropic與中國開源模型的激烈競爭，OpenAI本週宣布放慢部分AI開發速度，以強化安全與防護措施。</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12px;margin-top:7px;\"><b style=\"color:#3b424f;\">The Verge</b> · <a href=\"https://www.theverge.com/ai-artificial-intelligence/982323/openai-hit-brakes-voluntary-pacing-ai\" style=\"color:#3b6cf6;text-decoration:none;\">原文連結</a></div>\n</div>\n\n<div style=\"background:#fdeef0;border-left:5px solid #e0738a;border-radius:10px;padding:13px 16px;margin-bottom:11px;\">\n  <div style=\"font-size:15px;font-weight:800;color:#16213e;line-height:1.4;\"><span style=\"color:#e0738a;font-weight:800;\">2.</span> Nvidia just showed that the harness, not the AI model, is now the real hero<span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#fff;color:#d83a5e;font-size:11px;font-weight:700;padding:1px 8px;border-radius:20px;margin-left:5px;\">研究</span></div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:13px;color:#5b6470;margin:3px 0 6px;\">Nvidia研究揭示：關鍵在於代理框架，而非AI模型本身</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#555c68;line-height:1.55;\">Nvidia research shows that AI agents can perform well, and not go off the deep end, through fine-tuning, even if the AI model isn't that great at the task.</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#8a909c;margin-top:3px;line-height:1.55;\">Nvidia的研究顯示，即使AI模型本身表現不夠出色，透過微調代理框架（harness），AI代理仍能穩定發揮良好表現而不失控。</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12px;margin-top:7px;\"><b style=\"color:#3b424f;\">TechCrunch</b> · <a href=\"https://techcrunch.com/2026/08/21/nvidia-just-showed-that-the-harness-not-the-ai-model-is-now-the-real-hero/\" style=\"color:#3b6cf6;text-decoration:none;\">原文連結</a></div>\n</div>\n\n<div style=\"background:#edeefb;border-left:5px solid #6b72d6;border-radius:10px;padding:13px 16px;margin-bottom:11px;\">\n  <div style=\"font-size:15px;font-weight:800;color:#16213e;line-height:1.4;\"><span style=\"color:#6b72d6;font-weight:800;\">3.</span> The Powerful Chinese AI Model Experts Warned About Is Here<span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#fff;color:#5159c9;font-size:11px;font-weight:700;padding:1px 8px;border-radius:20px;margin-left:5px;\">模型</span></div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:13px;color:#5b6470;margin:3px 0 6px;\">專家警告的強大中國AI模型正式登場</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#555c68;line-height:1.55;\">Z.ai's latest AI model release could help companies secure their systems—or find its way into the hands of hackers.</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#8a909c;margin-top:3px;line-height:1.55;\">Z.ai最新發布的AI模型可能協助企業強化系統安全，但也可能落入駭客手中遭到濫用。</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12px;margin-top:7px;\"><b style=\"color:#3b424f;\">Wired</b> · <a href=\"https://www.wired.com/story/zai-open-weight-ai-models-release-cybersecurity-hacking/\" style=\"color:#3b6cf6;text-decoration:none;\">原文連結</a></div>\n</div>\n\n<div style=\"background:#e8f4fb;border-left:5px solid #3f97c9;border-radius:10px;padding:13px 16px;margin-bottom:11px;\">\n  <div style=\"font-size:15px;font-weight:800;color:#16213e;line-height:1.4;\"><span style=\"color:#3f97c9;font-weight:800;\">4.</span> Coders Say They Already Found Workarounds to Claude's Invisible Watermarks<span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#fff;color:#2b7fb0;font-size:11px;font-weight:700;padding:1px 8px;border-radius:20px;margin-left:5px;\">資安</span></div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:13px;color:#5b6470;margin:3px 0 6px;\">工程師稱已找到繞過Claude隱形水印的方法</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#555c68;line-height:1.55;\">Anthropic announced last week it would include invisible watermarks in AI-generated content to comply with new EU rules. Within hours, overrides were being touted online.</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#8a909c;margin-top:3px;line-height:1.55;\">Anthropic上週宣布為符合歐盟新規，將在AI生成內容中加入隱形水印，但短短數小時內，網路上已出現繞過水印的方法。</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12px;margin-top:7px;\"><b style=\"color:#3b424f;\">Wired</b> · <a href=\"https://www.wired.com/story/coders-say-they-already-found-workarounds-to-claudes-invisible-watermarks/\" style=\"color:#3b6cf6;text-decoration:none;\">原文連結</a></div>\n</div>\n\n<div style=\"background:#f2f6e8;border-left:5px solid #88a83f;border-radius:10px;padding:13px 16px;margin-bottom:11px;\">\n  <div style=\"font-size:15px;font-weight:800;color:#16213e;line-height:1.4;\"><span style=\"color:#88a83f;font-weight:800;\">5.</span> Google's Gemma Downloads Surpass 1 Billion, Spawning Over 100,000 Derivative Models<span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#fff;color:#6e8c28;font-size:11px;font-weight:700;padding:1px 8px;border-radius:20px;margin-left:5px;\">模型</span></div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:13px;color:#5b6470;margin:3px 0 6px;\">Google Gemma下載突破10億次，衍生逾10萬模型</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#555c68;line-height:1.55;\">Google announced on Thursday that cumulative downloads of its open Gemma model family have surpassed 1 billion, with developers releasing over 100,000 derivative models over the past two years to form what Google calls the \"Gemmaverse.\"</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#8a909c;margin-top:3px;line-height:1.55;\">Google周四（8/20）宣布，旗下開放AI模型Gemma家族累計下載次數已突破10億次，過去兩年開發者也已發布超過10萬個Gemma衍生模型，形成Google稱為「Gemmaverse」的開發者生態系。</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12px;margin-top:7px;\"><b style=\"color:#3b424f;\">iThome</b> · <a href=\"https://www.ithome.com.tw/news/178343\" style=\"color:#3b6cf6;text-decoration:none;\">原文連結</a></div>\n</div>\n\n<div style=\"background:#f9edf6;border-left:5px solid #c56bb0;border-radius:10px;padding:13px 16px;margin-bottom:11px;\">\n  <div style=\"font-size:15px;font-weight:800;color:#16213e;line-height:1.4;\"><span style=\"color:#c56bb0;font-weight:800;\">6.</span> Starcloud raises $250 million for orbital data centers as launch options dry up<span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#fff;color:#b04b9b;font-size:11px;font-weight:700;padding:1px 8px;border-radius:20px;margin-left:5px;\">產業</span></div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:13px;color:#5b6470;margin:3px 0 6px;\">Starcloud募得2.5億美元投入軌道資料中心，因發射機會日益稀缺</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#555c68;line-height:1.55;\">There's about to be a big fight to secure access to space.</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#8a909c;margin-top:3px;line-height:1.55;\">隨著火箭發射機會日漸緊縮，一場爭奪太空資源的大戰即將展開。</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12px;margin-top:7px;\"><b style=\"color:#3b424f;\">TechCrunch</b> · <a href=\"https://techcrunch.com/2026/08/21/starcloud-raises-200-million-for-orbital-data-centers-as-launch-options-dry-up/\" style=\"color:#3b6cf6;text-decoration:none;\">原文連結</a></div>\n</div>\n\n<div style=\"background:#eef4ff;border-left:5px solid #5b8def;border-radius:10px;padding:13px 16px;margin-bottom:11px;\">\n  <div style=\"font-size:15px;font-weight:800;color:#16213e;line-height:1.4;\"><span style=\"color:#5b8def;font-weight:800;\">7.</span> GitHub Reveals Cause of August Outage: Infrastructure Capacity Failed to Keep Up with Growth<span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#fff;color:#3b6cf6;font-size:11px;font-weight:700;padding:1px 8px;border-radius:20px;margin-left:5px;\">產業</span></div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:13px;color:#5b6470;margin:3px 0 6px;\">GitHub揭露8月大當機原因，基礎設施容量未跟上使用成長</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#555c68;line-height:1.55;\">GitHub said its August 17 outage investigation found the incident wasn't caused by code or configuration changes, but by infrastructure capacity failing to keep pace with platform growth, causing a nearly 8-hour multi-service outage.</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#8a909c;margin-top:3px;line-height:1.55;\">GitHub公布8月17日大規模服務中斷調查結果，指出事故並非程式或組態變更所致，而是基礎設施容量未能跟上使用量成長，最終導致多項服務中斷近8小時。</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12px;margin-top:7px;\"><b style=\"color:#3b424f;\">iThome</b> · <a href=\"https://www.ithome.com.tw/news/178335\" style=\"color:#3b6cf6;text-decoration:none;\">原文連結</a></div>\n</div>\n\n<div style=\"background:#ecf7ef;border-left:5px solid #4caf72;border-radius:10px;padding:13px 16px;margin-bottom:11px;\">\n  <div style=\"font-size:15px;font-weight:800;color:#16213e;line-height:1.4;\"><span style=\"color:#4caf72;font-weight:800;\">8.</span> Debates over AI consciousness are a trap<span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#fff;color:#1e9e57;font-size:11px;font-weight:700;padding:1px 8px;border-radius:20px;margin-left:5px;\">研究</span></div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:13px;color:#5b6470;margin:3px 0 6px;\">AI意識辯論是個陷阱</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#555c68;line-height:1.55;\">Terms like \"runaway\" AI and \"rogue\" agents suggest AI is not only aware but angry at its creators, and tech leaders including Demis Hassabis, Dario Amodei, and Sam Altman are pushing regulation based on this framing.</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#8a909c;margin-top:3px;line-height:1.55;\">「失控」的AI、「叛逃」的代理人等說法，讓人以為AI不僅具有意識，還對創造者心懷怨恨，包括Demis Hassabis、Dario Amodei與Sam Altman等科技領袖都據此推動監管。</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12px;margin-top:7px;\"><b style=\"color:#3b424f;\">MIT Technology Review</b> · <a href=\"https://www.technologyreview.com/2026/08/20/1142571/ai-consciousness-debate-trap/\" style=\"color:#3b6cf6;text-decoration:none;\">原文連結</a></div>\n</div>\n\n<div style=\"background:#f1ecfb;border-left:5px solid #8a6bd8;border-radius:10px;padding:13px 16px;margin-bottom:11px;\">\n  <div style=\"font-size:15px;font-weight:800;color:#16213e;line-height:1.4;\"><span style=\"color:#8a6bd8;font-weight:800;\">9.</span> Binance now lets AI agents trade, but keeping them in check is largely up to users<span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#fff;color:#6b3bf6;font-size:11px;font-weight:700;padding:1px 8px;border-radius:20px;margin-left:5px;\">產品</span></div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:13px;color:#5b6470;margin:3px 0 6px;\">幣安開放AI代理進行交易，風險控管責任主要落在使用者身上</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#555c68;line-height:1.55;\">Binance's Agent OS works with tools such as ChatGPT, Claude Code, and Cursor.</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#8a909c;margin-top:3px;line-height:1.55;\">幣安的Agent OS可與ChatGPT、Claude Code、Cursor等工具搭配使用。</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12px;margin-top:7px;\"><b style=\"color:#3b424f;\">TechCrunch</b> · <a href=\"https://techcrunch.com/2026/08/20/binance-now-lets-ai-agents-trade-but-keeping-them-in-check-is-largely-up-to-users/\" style=\"color:#3b6cf6;text-decoration:none;\">原文連結</a></div>\n</div>\n\n<div style=\"background:#e8f6f5;border-left:5px solid #2bb0a6;border-radius:10px;padding:13px 16px;margin-bottom:11px;\">\n  <div style=\"font-size:15px;font-weight:800;color:#16213e;line-height:1.4;\"><span style=\"color:#2bb0a6;font-weight:800;\">10.</span> Cisco Patches Critical Flaws in Crosswork Network Automation Platform, One Scoring a Perfect CVSS 10<span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#fff;color:#0f9b9b;font-size:11px;font-weight:700;padding:1px 8px;border-radius:20px;margin-left:5px;\">資安</span></div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:13px;color:#5b6470;margin:3px 0 6px;\">思科修補網路自動化與協同管理平臺Crosswork滿分重大漏洞</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#555c68;line-height:1.55;\">On August 19, Cisco patched four critical vulnerabilities in its Crosswork platform — CVE-2026-20030, CVE-2026-20357, CVE-2026-20358, and CVE-2026-20359 — with three scoring a perfect CVSS 10 and the fourth at 9.9, affecting all versions before 7.2.1.</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#8a909c;margin-top:3px;line-height:1.55;\">8月19日思科發布資安公告，修補Crosswork平臺四個重大漏洞，其中三個CVSS評分達滿分10分，另一個為9.9分，影響7.2.1以前的所有版本。</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12px;margin-top:7px;\"><b style=\"color:#3b424f;\">iThome</b> · <a href=\"https://www.ithome.com.tw/news/178334\" style=\"color:#3b6cf6;text-decoration:none;\">原文連結</a></div>\n</div>\n\n<div style=\"text-align:center;font-size:11.5px;color:#9aa1ad;padding-top:10px;\">由 AI News Digest 從各家 RSS 自動挑選、翻譯並寄送</div>\n</div>\n"}